# Dack Fayden: +1 (target player draws two cards, then discards two) on turns 5, 7 and 9 takes him from 3 to 6 loyalty;
# on turn 11 his -6 gives Bot1 the emblem "Whenever you cast a spell that targets one or more permanents, gain control
# of those permanents", and he dies. Bot1 then casts All That Glitters, an Aura, on Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla: the
# emblem's ability goes above the spell, so Bot1 controls the Gorilla before the Aura resolves, and it enters
# attached to a creature Bot1 owns for the rest of the game (CR 108.4: no duration).

